{"term": {"label": "性", "occurrences": 22, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "口", "id": "口"}, {"form": "味", "id": "味"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "杞", "id": "杞"}, {"form": "柳", "id": "柳"}, {"form": "桮", "id": "桮"}, {"form": "棬", "id": "棬"}, {"form": "歟", "id": "歟"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "白", "id": "白"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.9934991118791112, "source": "柳", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 3.728100167267218, "source": "柳", "target": "杞"}, {"weight": 3.5049566159530077, "source": "柳", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 3.5049566159530077, "source": "柳", "target": "棬"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "柳", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 0.5584145865897886, "source": "白", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 0.8266785731844679, "source": "白", "target": "生"}, {"weight": 2.005333569526114, "source": "白", "target": "歟"}, {"weight": 0.7125652664170469, "source": "子", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "子", "target": "杞"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "子", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 1.9363406980391626, "source": "子", "target": "棬"}, {"weight": 2.0417012136969888, "source": "今", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 1.1478833376748925, "source": "今", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.7125652664170469, "source": "今", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6933945194287732, "source": "水", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.4355654101266735, "source": "水", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 0.8948868232110015, "source": "食", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.1631508098056809, "source": "食", "target": "生"}